{"4509230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blue Dimension: Save the Game", "steam_appid": 4509230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 OCTOBER 2026 STEAM NEXT FEST: READY UP! 🚨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of the Blue Dimension are opening. Add the game to your wishlist now to play the free Early Demo and be among the first to step into this ruthless universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/829526fdcb5cd58516f7b418a7a1d42e.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/829526fdcb5cd58516f7b418a7a1d42e.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/829526fdcb5cd58516f7b418a7a1d42e.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This labyrinth shows no mercy. When you fall, your consciousness transfers to your loyal drone. Return to the revival center, unlock the keyed door to teleport into the next combat arena, and unleash devastating headshots with your rifle to harvest enemy souls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ad28733af7ea710448420cfc90b70d11.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ad28733af7ea710448420cfc90b70d11.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ad28733af7ea710448420cfc90b70d11.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find hidden holograms across each level to completely change your playstyle. Choose the tactical tech module that fits your strategy; add headshot abilities to drone shots, </i>unlock a temporary rifle power-up tied to your ultimate bar<i>, or boost your movement speed. Create your ultimate combination.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ef375cd00dff32b0790c8546da9ef12c.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ef375cd00dff32b0790c8546da9ef12c.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ef375cd00dff32b0790c8546da9ef12c.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the labyrinth, you will search for the Master Key at critical points. But be careful—you will be pulled into the 'Blue Dimension.' Master rocket jumps and platform mechanics in this altered realm to find a way back to the main world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/269560214ba624ae1114cece04fc19d9.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/269560214ba624ae1114cece04fc19d9.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/269560214ba624ae1114cece04fc19d9.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trapped in a dark cyberpunk labyrinth.</i> <i>Destroy enemies to clear locked paths, collect falling souls to fill your Ultimate bar, and unleash devastating firepower.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 OCTOBER 2026 STEAM NEXT FEST: READY UP! 🚨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of the Blue Dimension are opening. Add the game to your wishlist now to play the free Early Demo and be among the first to step into this ruthless universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/829526fdcb5cd58516f7b418a7a1d42e.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/829526fdcb5cd58516f7b418a7a1d42e.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/829526fdcb5cd58516f7b418a7a1d42e.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This labyrinth shows no mercy. When you fall, your consciousness transfers to your loyal drone. Return to the revival center, unlock the keyed door to teleport into the next combat arena, and unleash devastating headshots with your rifle to harvest enemy souls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ad28733af7ea710448420cfc90b70d11.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ad28733af7ea710448420cfc90b70d11.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ad28733af7ea710448420cfc90b70d11.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find hidden holograms across each level to completely change your playstyle. Choose the tactical tech module that fits your strategy; add headshot abilities to drone shots, </i>unlock a temporary rifle power-up tied to your ultimate bar<i>, or boost your movement speed. Create your ultimate combination.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ef375cd00dff32b0790c8546da9ef12c.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ef375cd00dff32b0790c8546da9ef12c.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/ef375cd00dff32b0790c8546da9ef12c.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the labyrinth, you will search for the Master Key at critical points. But be careful—you will be pulled into the 'Blue Dimension.' Master rocket jumps and platform mechanics in this altered realm to find a way back to the main world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/269560214ba624ae1114cece04fc19d9.poster.avif?t=1786779850\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/269560214ba624ae1114cece04fc19d9.webm?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/extras/269560214ba624ae1114cece04fc19d9.mp4?t=1786779850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trapped in a dark cyberpunk labyrinth.</i> <i>Destroy enemies to clear locked paths, collect falling souls to fill your Ultimate bar, and unleash devastating firepower.</i></p>", "short_description": "Stop them before they take it all! You are the last defense as the digital dimension collapses. In this fast-paced Action FPS, shred enemies, harvest their souls to grow stronger, and master rocket jumps to survive brutal platforming. Can you crash the system and save the last one?", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/a78b023ccc93d1a499800de5cf5009c8c1ca9906/header.jpg?t=1786779850", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/b6c82521db85b781d8a1599aa77dbe9ccfb287ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786779850", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509230/b6c82521db85b781d8a1599aa77dbe9ccfb287ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786779850", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3050 / GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The requirements are set targeting 'High' graphics settings and 1080p/30 FPS. To preserve artistic details, the graphics settings are set to High by default.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operat